guide forever/professions/enchanting
title Enchanting 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Enchanting` from Era-baseline data:
# Blizzard Classic Era client tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents,
# vendor prices) via wago.tools, pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated
# trainer list checked against npcs.json. Nothing public confirms Forever
# changed profession recipes, so the Era recipe list is the baseline.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-75  Enchant Bracer - Minor Health (about 75)
#    75-100 Enchant Bracer - Minor Health (about 49)
#   100-130 Enchant Bracer - Minor Stamina (about 54)
#   130-140 Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility (about 11)
#   140-150 Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength (about 10)
#   150-180 Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength (about 34)
#   180-200 Enchant Chest - Greater Health (about 28)
#   200-225 Enchant Bracer - Strength (about 39)
#   225-250 Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (about 39)
#   250-275 Lesser Mana Oil (about 37)
#   275-300 Wizard Oil (about 37)

step Apprentice Enchanting
  tip Enchanting runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 5g 94s in all.
  train Enchanting Apprentice
  skill Enchanting 1
  buy 6217 x1 nearest

step Enchanting materials for 1-75
  tip Skinned, disenchanted or crafted by another profession: gather them yourself or buy them on the Auction House.
  collect 10938 x1 -- Enchanting: disenchant uncommon (green) gear (or the Auction House)
  collect 10940 x76 -- Enchanting: disenchant uncommon (green) gear (or the Auction House)

step Enchant Bracer - Minor Health to 75
  tip Orange (a point every craft) until 70, yellow until 90, green until 110. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do. 75 is the Apprentice cap.
  craft 7421 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 7418 until 75
  skill Enchanting 75

step Journeyman Enchanting
  tip Journeyman needs character level 10 and Enchanting 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 30g in all.
  level 10
  train Enchanting Journeyman

step Formula: Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility
  tip Teaches Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility (needs Enchanting 110). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 11039 nearest

step Formula: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength
  tip Teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength (needs Enchanting 140). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 11101 nearest

step Shadowgem (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Shadowgem comes from Copper Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too.
  collect 1210 x1 @38.5,48.9 era

